  "description": {
    "pve": {
      "en": "Enchantment Spell. You gain 1...3...3 Energy for each foe within earshot, maximum 8 Energy. For 10 seconds afterward, this enchantment does nothing. When this enchantment ends, you gain 1...3...3 Energy for each foe within earshot, maximum 8 Energy.",
